      "comment" : "Home button that opens the list of nearby games."
    },
    "Keep the app open. You’ll be back in the game as soon as the host’s phone is nearby." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
